        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Gnome Queen sets off on an incredible journey to the Cheese Moon to save the Troll Queen, who has been turned into a titan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the gnomes, explore mysterious lands, help encountered creatures, battle the Order of the Red Rose, and find the mighty Rat King!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The future of an entire planet depends only on you! Fight, build, explore, and uncover all the secrets of the Cheese Moon! Are you ready to save the world?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gnomes Garden is a classic time-management game with worker assignment: on each level you quickly gather resources (food/wood/stone/crystals), build and upgrade structures (farm, sawmill, quarry, mine, workers’ house), clear obstacles, and manage to complete the objectives for ‘3 stars’ before the timer runs out, using temporary boosts (speed-up, time stop, construction speed-up).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Mighty Rat King and the mysterious Silver Rat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Grand gnome adventure across the magical Cheese Moon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Incredible secrets and a new story in the Gnome Queen's world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Explosions of vivid colors and living comics about great adventures!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. Fantastically updated art style: magic in every frame!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6. New production chains to create the rarest wonderful resources!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7. Unique fantasy locations: cheese castles, mystical forests, shining plains!</p>",
